Catalog service: min_w/min_d/min_h hard filters and a mount per item (search_furniture, get_item).
Draft for the main repo (catalog/), against catalog/search.py and catalog/mcp_server.py at 9b8a09fd (same as the VM).
Not deployed. Apply in the main repo: patch -p1 < catalog-mount-and-min-size.patch; then catalog tests, then deploy.
With it, packages/scene-mcp can send min_* to the service (exact paging, no 6-page cap) and read mount from it.

